  "finalText": "`paginate.js` was treating page numbers as if they started at 0, so page 2 was slicing from index 2×perPage instead of 1×perPage. Since the tests count pages from 1, everything shifted one page too far.\n\nFixed the start offset to `(page - 1) * perPage`. All 5 tests pass now, 74ms.",
